1 NOTE JEAN2 BLANCHARD (GUILLAUME1) was born 1611 in Martaize, Loudun, Vienne, France., and died Unknown in Acadia.He married RADEGONDE JOY LAMBERT 1642 in Port Royal, Acadia. Notes for JEAN BLANCHARD:Jean Blanchard, son of Guillaume Blanchard and Huguett
2 CONC e (Poirier) Blanchard, born 1611, in Martaize, Vienne, France, died in Acadia; married in Port Royal, Acadia, about 1642, to Radegonde Joy Lambert, born 1615, in France. Jean arrived in Acadie about 1636, accompanying his parents. In the 1671 censu
2 CONC s he is listed as a plowman at Port Royal having 5 arpents of plowed land. The 1678 and 1686 cencuses again show them at Port Royal; in the latter census both being shown at age 75. 
2 CONT http://www.genealogy.com/ftm/b/l/a/Ronald-J-Blanchard/GENE2-0002.html
2 CONT RIN: MH:N501018
2 CONT REFN: 14 DEC 2015 16:11:29
