1 NOTE Juho Lahtinen, a relative in Finland, researched Simon for me and found the following: 
2 CONT 26.11.1809 3.12.1809 Allboa     Trp. Simon Hendilä Carin Pehrsdtr   35-40 Simon
2 CONT 23.2.1813 23.2.1813 Allboa     Torp. Simon Mattsson Hendilä Carin Pehrsdr.   40-45 Jacob died same die
2 CONT 23.2.1813 23.2.1813 Allboa     Torp. Simon Mattsson Hendilä Carin Pehrsdr.   40-45 Henrik died next day
2 CONT 25.12.1815 26.12.1815 Allboa Hendilä Simon Mattsson   Carin Pehrsdr.   40-45 Zacharias
2 CONT "Yesterday I asked help on genealogy forum and there one lady found that movedocument which I sent you. Now digging more myself and find these which I sent yesterday evening and just now. Finding I always so interesting...Simon surname when he wa
2 CONC s born was Wuolunparras. Later name Hellman is probably from Army and change again to Hendilä in Vihanti, Alpua village." I asked why the name would change when he went in the army and he replied: "Not sure, but there is many with name Hellman in t
2 CONC he army. That time people when they join to army had new name from Army. Just is published a book of people of northostrobotnia area who joined the army 1600-1800 centuries. I have ordered it, but not yet have it. If he was in the army, I will hav
2 CONC e more info later." English is not Juho's first language.
2 CONT RIN: MH:N500815
2 CONT REFN: 14 DEC 2015 16:11:29
