2 CONT 1.  Jean Poirier was born about 1621 in La Chaussée, Loudun, Poitou, France.  He died in 1654. He was married to Jeanne Chabrat (daughter of Antoine Chabrat and Françoise Chaumeret) in 1648 in Port-Royal, Acadie.  Jeanne Chabrat was born on 5 Feb 1
2 CONC 627 in La Chaussée, Loudun, Poitou, France.  Jean Poirier and Jeanne Chabrol had the following children: 
2 CONT +2 i. Marie-Françoise Poirier. 
2 CONT +3 ii. Michel Poirier.website listing descendents (in french): http://genealogie.planete.qc.ca/base/lignee/names.php?gene_action=&amp;gene_no_lignee=540Came to work in the fisheries established by Nicolas Denys.
2 CONT RIN: MH:N501017
2 CONT REFN: 14 DEC 2015 16:11:29
