1 _DSCR When James Joseph Welsh was born in March 1871 in Petaluma, California, his father, Thomas, was 23 and his mother, Ann, was 32. He married Cordellia Agee on April 29, 1903. They had nine children in 17 years. He made his living as a truck driver fo
2 CONC r a transfer compant. He died on March 24, 1956, in Aberdeen, Washington, at the age of 85.
