2 CONC &gt;&amp;nbsp;The location of this treasury of objects has moved over time, The locations was unknown until the 15th century when it was located in St. Matthew's Chapel until 1873, when it was moved to Charles Chapel. From there it was moved, in 18
2 CONC 81, to the Hungarian Chapel, and in 1931 to its present location next to the Poor Souls' Chapel.&lt;sup style="line-height: 1; font-size: 11.1999998092651px; unicode-bidi: -webkit-isolate;"&gt;[58]&lt;/sup&gt;&amp;nbsp;Of the original&amp;nbsp;Caro
