2 CONC magne.Maximilian I&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Charles V&amp;nbsp;both gave numerous works of art by&amp;nbsp;Hans von Reutlingen.&lt;sup style="line-height: 1; font-size: 11.1999998092651px; unicode-bidi: -webkit-isolate;"&gt;[58]&lt;/sup&gt;&amp;nbsp;C
