2 CONC e;"&gt;[63]&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sup style="line-height: 1; font-size: 11.1999998092651px; unicode-bidi: -webkit-isolate;"&gt;[64]&lt;/sup&gt;&amp;nbsp;One of the contributors for the reconstructions of the synagogue was&amp;nbsp;J&amp;uuml;rgen Linden
