1 _DSCR This is the monument in Quebec City to Louis Herbert, Marie Rollet, and Guillaume Couillard. This monument includes a statue of Louis offering his first sheaf of wheat to God. It was carved by Alfred Laliberté and erected in 1918 to mark the 300t
