1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Jhering [-je], Joakim, priest;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #fff"&gt;d. July 18, 1657 in Stockholm, in 1620 became vicar&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-co
2 CONC lor: #fff"&gt;Nyk&amp;ouml;ping in the eastern parish, and in 1638 Bishop&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in Estonia. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;As such,&amp;nbsp;he developed highly&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #fff"&gt;
2 CONC meritorious activities, in that he established&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: #fff"&gt;an orderly church board, introduced Pastor meetings&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and searches, and brought about unity in&lt;br&gt;
2 CONC &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Church mills and better education of the peasantry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;In Swedish:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jhering [je-], &lt;strong style="background-color: #ffff66; color: black"&gt;Joakim&lt;
2 CONC /strong&gt;, pr&amp;auml;st (f&amp;ouml;delse&amp;aring;r obekant), &lt;br&gt;d. 18 juli 1657 i Stockholm, blef 1620 kyrkoherde &lt;br&gt;i Nyk&amp;ouml;pings &amp;ouml;stra f&amp;ouml;rsamling och 1638 biskop &lt;br&gt;i Estland. Som s&amp;aring;d
2 CONC an utvecklade J. synnerligen &lt;br&gt;f&amp;ouml;rtj&amp;auml;nstfull verksamhet, i det att han uppr&amp;auml;ttade &lt;br&gt;en ordnad kyrkostyrelse, inf&amp;ouml;rde pr&amp;auml;st-m&amp;ouml;ten &lt;br&gt;och visitationer samt s&amp;ouml;kte &a
2 CONC mp;aring;v&amp;auml;gabringa enhet i &lt;br&gt;kyrkobruken och b&amp;auml;ttre undervisning af allmogen. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;http://runeberg.org/nfcp/0407.html&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;http://www.oberg-forchheim.de/ahnen/f_16e.htm &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt
2 CONC ;/span&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
