1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; text-align: right; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'helvetica neue'; color: #323333; background-color: #f8f8f3; min-height: 15px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
2 CONC </line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 28px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'helvetica neue'; color: #695d49; background-color: #f8f8f3;"&gt;euDeuxi&amp;egrave;me g&amp;eacute;n&amp;eacute;ration&lt;span style="fo
2 CONC nt-size: 12px; font-family: helvetica; color: #000000; background-color: transparent;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: helvetica; min
2 CONC -height: 14px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'helvetica neue'; color: #323333;"&gt;Michel s'&amp;eacute;tablit &amp;agrave; Beaubassin (NE), Ac
2 CONC adie aujourd'hui, pr&amp;egrave;s de Ambhert, Nouvelle-&amp;Eacute;cosse en 1682, il en fut l'un des premiers colons.&amp;nbsp; en 1671, il vit seul &amp;agrave; Port-Royal et poss&amp;egrave;de 2 bovins, aucun mouton, aucune terre.&amp;nbsp; En 16
2 CONC 86, il s'est install&amp;eacute; &amp;agrave; Beaubassin et poss&amp;egrave;de 13 bovins, 3 brebis, 8 porcs, 7 acres "en valeur" et un fusil.&amp;nbsp; En 1693, 24 bovins, 25 brebis, 15 cochons, 30 arpents et 2 fusils.&amp;nbsp; En 1698, 25 bovins
2 CONC , 5 brebis, 2 porcs, 22 arpents, 2 arbres fruitiers et 2 fusils.&amp;nbsp; en 1700:&amp;nbsp; 25 bovins, 12 brebis, 8 porcs, 23 arpents et 2 fusils.&amp;nbsp; En 1701:&amp;nbsp; 7 fils, 17 bovins, 14 brebis, 6 cochons, 10 arpents et 3 fusils.&amp;n
2 CONC bsp; En 1703:&amp;nbsp; 7 fils, 1 fille, 3 pouvant porter les armes.&amp;nbsp; en 1707: 4 fils de plus de 14 ans, 20 bovins, 20 brebis, 12 cochons et 9 arpents.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; l
2 CONC ine-height: normal; font-family: helvetica; min-height: 14px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: helvetica; min-height: 14px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&g
2 CONC t;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: helvetica; min-height: 14px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-
2 CONC height: normal; font-family: helvetica;"&gt;A rough Google translation:&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: helvetica; min-height: 14px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</l
2 CONC ine><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: helvetica;"&gt;In 1682, Michel lived at Beaubassin (NE) Canada near what is today Amherst, Nova Sc
2 CONC otia. He was one of the first settlers. in 1671, he lived alone in Port Royal and had 2 cattle, no sheep, no land. In 1686, he moved to Beaubassin and had 13 cattle, 3 sheep, 8 pigs, 7 acres "value" and a gun. In 1693, he had 24 cattle, 25 sheep, 1
2 CONC 5 pigs, 30 acres and 2 guns. In 1698: 25 cattle, 5 sheep, 2 pigs, 22 acres, 2 fruit trees and 2 guns. in 1700: 25 cattle, 12 sheep, 8 pigs, 23 acres and 2 guns. 1701: 7 sons, 17 cattle, 14 sheep, 6 pigs, 10 acres and 3 guns. 1703: 7 sons, 1 daughte
2 CONC r, 3 guns. 1707: 4 sons older than 14 years, 20 cattle, 20 sheep, 12 pigs and 9 acres.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
