1 _OID 780f732b-8b6f-42e3-8308-4a3984ff11b7
1 _DSCR John as a young man.  He was 25 when he came to the US.  A grandson remembers being told he came through Canada.  His birth name was Johan Michel Kiiskila.  His mother's maiden name was Helllman.  When he came to America he changed it to his father
2 CONC 's dismay.  However, the story is that when he took his citizenship test, the e looked like it was dotted, so his last name became Hillman.
