1 _DSCR Caption: "These happy liberated prisoners of war who recently flew acrosss the Pacific to San Francisco, reached Vancouver en route home. Here they pose for the photographer beside the railway coach that bore them from the California city. All memb
2 CONC ers of the famed Royal Rifles of Canada, they are shown here in the front row (from left to right): Rfn. G.H. McKee, Chapleau, Ont.; Rfn. J.E. Glenn, Trenton, Ont.; Rfn. C.A. Wurm, Arnprior, Ont.; Rfn. M.T. Murray, Oshawa, Ont. Back row: Sgt. E.E
2 CONC . Dissing, London, Ont.; Rfn. J.A. Gauthier, Flint, Michigan, USA.; Rfn. D.E. Southworth, Campbellford, Ont.; Rfn. K.R. Inche, Ostawa, Ont.; Rfn. Frederick A. Cooper, Sutton West, Ont." (Canadian Army Photo)
