1 DATE 1643-1717
1 _META <metadataxml><cemetery /><transcription>Translated Remarks:  He was a ship's captain. The following acts are from Darcey (St-Bénign). His father b. 13-01-1616 and inh. 25-01-1707. His mother inh. at 50 years of age on 26-12-1670. Five brothers an
2 CONC d one sister were baptized: Joseph, born 1646 inh. at 22 years on 01-02-1668; Jean-1, 02-04-1651; Mathias on 02-04-1655 married at Grésigny-Ste-Reine (21307) on 21-07-1693 with Marie Daubenton (widow of Jacques Baretat) Anne on 24-02-1658 Jean-2, b
2 CONC orn about 1660, buried on 22-11-1670 and Francois, 13-07-1664. His paternal grandparents were François Perrot and Étiennette Chamereau (Claude and Anne Hérault).</transcription></metadataxml>
