2 TITL Barbara Gloyner Bashor Bethrothed to Las Cruces Man Milan Robert Miller
1 _OID b6a8f845-b6c1-4107-b60e-32c89155db86
1 DATE 15 Mar 1952
1 PLAC Hanford, Kings, California, USA
1 _META <metadataxml><transcription>Barbara Gloyner Bashor Betrothed to Las Cruces Man 
2 CONT A June Wedding in New Mexico has been scheduled by a former Kings County elementary school teacher and a Las Cruces, N. M. business man.  Announcement of the betrothal of Barbara Gloyne Bashor and Milan Robert "Mick" Miller was made today by Mr. an
2 CONC d Mrs. J. N. Gloyne of Sun Valley, parents of the bride-elect.  An alumna of San Fernando high school and Glendale City college, she attended Fresno State college and the University of Southern California.  For three years she has been teaching i
2 CONC n California elementary schools,  spending one term with Willow Grove school here.  She currently is teaching the fourth grade at White Sands school in New Mexico.  The bride-elect makes her home in Las Cruces with a sister, Mr.s Roy Gallagher.  Th
2 CONC e prospective bridegroom, a native California, is in business with his father at Las Cruces.</transcription></metadataxml>
