1 PLAC McMinnville, Yamhill County, Oregon
1 _DSCR The eldest boy here is Joseph Irvin "Irving" Agee who was the son of Great-grandfather Jack Agee and his 1st wife, Marcella Downing. Next to him is his sister Margaret Cordelia "Dilly" Agee also of the 1st marriage. Left to right on front row are
2 CONC :  Annie BAKER Agee holding Oscar Agee, Anna Lucretia, Calvin, Elma,  my grandmother Laura & Great-Grandfather Jack Agee holding Ed. (Loren was born a year later.)
