1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>SIMON MARCI KROOK. &lt;br&gt; Kyrkoherde i N&amp;ouml;teborg senast 1628.&lt;br&gt; Born about 1595 &amp;Aring;bo or nearby. Death 1656. &lt;br&gt; -Spouse 1: Anna &lt;br&gt; -Spouse 2: Helena Larsdotter. &lt;br&gt; &lt;
2 CONC br&gt; Simon&amp;#39;s and Anna&amp;#39;s son:&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; Benjamin Simonii Krook. &lt;br&gt; Kyrkoherde i Nyen 1666. Stud. i &amp;Aring;bo 1648; Death 1675. &lt;br&gt;  -Spouse 1: 4.12.1660 Vendla Claudiusdotter Thesleff Krook. Death  20.
2 CONC 10.1661 Viipuri. &lt;br&gt; -Spouse 2: 20.1.1663 Viipuri Kristina Nicolausdotter Nycopensis Agrelius  Krook. &lt;br&gt;  (Her 1. spouse Martinus Erici Agrelius. Death 1661. )&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; Kristina&amp;#39;s father:&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; Nico
2 CONC laus Laurentii Nycopensis. &lt;br&gt; Biskop i Viipuri 1658. Death 23.4.1662. Born Nyk&amp;ouml;ping, Sweden&lt;br&gt; -Spouse Katarina Joachimsdotter Iheringius Jhering Nycopensis. &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; Katarina&amp;#39;s parents: &lt;br&gt; JOACH
2 CONC IM IHERING Jhering. &lt;br&gt; Biskop I Reval. Born Sweden, S&amp;ouml;dermanland. Death 18.7.1657 Stockholm. &lt;br&gt; Kristiina  Sp&amp;auml;rman &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; * * * Ref. Ky&amp;ouml;sti V&amp;auml;&amp;auml;n&amp;auml;nen: He
2 CONC rdaminne f&amp;ouml;r Ingermanland I. Lutherska  stiftsstyrelsen, f&amp;ouml;rsamlingarnas pr&amp;auml;sterskap och skoll&amp;auml;rare i  Ingermanland under svenska tiden. 346 s. Helsingfors 1987. (Skrifter  utgivna av Svenska litteraturs&amp;auml
2 CONC ;llskapet i Finland nr. 538.) &lt;br&gt; * * * Ref. NYCOPENSIS, NYKOPP-suku Nyk&amp;ouml;pingist&amp;auml;.  Suomen aatelittomia  sukuja. I-II. Axel Bergholm, red. Helsingfors 1892-1901.&lt;br&gt; * * * Ref. KROOK, Suomen aatelittomia sukuja. I-II
2 CONC . Axel Bergholm, red.  Helsingfors 1892-1901. &lt;br&gt; </line></content></metadataxml>
